WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.850
You say in the film, like, what am I gonna do,

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.230
almost, when I'm steady and good.

3
00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.483
Like, will you know how to write?

4
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:12.083
Right.

5
00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:16.267
When things are so stable?

6
00:00:17.698 --> 00:00:18.930
(Olivia laughs)

7
00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.750
And does life ever even get there? But-

8
00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:23.430
You know, I definitely like to think

9
00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:25.410
that it's gonna be even better than.

10
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:29.640
I think you have to be stable and feel full

11
00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.110
in order to give so much of yourself to your art.

12
00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:32.943
And so I think

13
00:00:32.943 --> 00:00:34.410
if you're just like constantly depriving yourself

14
00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.107
and you're constantly sad, then your art suffers in a way.

15
00:00:37.107 --> 00:00:37.940
I agree.
Know what I mean?

16
00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.620
And a lot of people get like into drugs,

17
00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.453
and they do this and they're like-

18
00:00:40.453 --> 00:00:43.010
Yeah. Ooh.
It's an excuse for art.

19
00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:44.170
I've been there. I've tried that.

20
00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.490
And I'm like, you know what? That's not sustainable.

21
00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:48.040
It's definitely a weird thing to like write

22
00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.550
about your personal life sometimes, but-

23
00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:51.700
No, it's the only way-

24
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:53.430
I think so-
To do it.

25
00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:57.680
And when you write, do you think about someone hearing it,

26
00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:00.670
seeing it, listening to it, or do you write it just for you?

27
00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.761
Never. I always write just from me.

28
00:01:02.761 --> 00:01:03.594
(hands clapping)

29
00:01:03.594 --> 00:01:06.630
I knew this. I knew this about you, I knew it.

30
00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.490
I think the second you start thinking about

31
00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:10.400
how something's gonna start being perceived,

32
00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.700
it just loses all of its magic.

33
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.870
And I think it, I try to be as vulnerable

34
00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:16.700
and honest as possible in my songs.

35
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.140
I think that's like one of the hallmarks

36
00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:18.973
of good songwriting.

37
00:01:18.973 --> 00:01:19.970
And I think when you're thinking about

38
00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.000
how people are gonna perceive it,

39
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:25.080
it just makes it so hard to do that, it's anxiety inducing.

40
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:26.000
So yeah-

41
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.950
Such a relief to hear you say that.

42
00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:28.783
Yeah.

43
00:01:29.660 --> 00:01:32.100
I'm so inspired by you.

44
00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.340
You have made the world a better place.

45
00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:39.030
And in my heart of hearts, I wondered and secretly hoped

46
00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:42.280
that you were having that insular experience,

47
00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:45.870
because I think that's what makes it the most humble

48
00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:49.297
and relatable and universal.
(audience applauds)

49
00:01:49.297 --> 00:01:52.180
Oh, Olivia, thank you so much for your time.

50
00:01:52.180 --> 00:01:53.700
I just love you so much.

51
00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.770
Olivia Rodrigo, Driving Home 2 U,

52
00:01:56.770 --> 00:01:59.930
premieres March 25th, only on Disney Plus,

53
00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:03.128 line:15%
I'm sure everyone will be watching.

54
00:02:03.128 --> 00:02:06.211 line:15%
(upbeat theme music)

